 -- Apache-2.0: the boot loader under FSBL/ (FSBL/LICENSE). It contains ST's
    SLA0044 External Memory Manager, listed above.

 -- BSD-3-Clause, MIT or Apache-2.0, third-party: the STM32N6 HAL and CMSIS
    in Drivers/ (with Ohm Lab Ltd's changes to two HAL files), the ST camera
    drivers, the Verisilicon VC8000NanoE encoder and ST's wrapper, FreeRTOS,
    TinyUSB, CMSIS-DSP, lwIP with NXP's HTTP server, NXP's Wi-Fi driver, OS
    abstraction and Mbed TLS transport (Middlewares/NeuroN6/Tls/
    wm_mbedtls_net.c), Apache NimBLE and the configuration derived from it
    (Middlewares/NeuroN6/BleHost/include/syscfg/syscfg.h), Mbed TLS, and the
    patched HAL SDIO driver and HAL headers for the compile harness.

 Ohm Lab Ltd's own code under other terms:

